            <div xml:id="d1494">

                <pb facs="1250" n="1146" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1146"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 823.00/110.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé d’Affaires at Panama to the
                        Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Panama</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-08-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 20, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Department’s August 11. Ex-President Leguía of Peru arrived yesterday. I have
                    informed Canal Zone authorities. Met and escorted Leguía to hotel. He expects to
                    remain about two weeks, sailing via Jamaica for New York and Europe.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wicker</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
